<title>INDONESIA: Bank Niaga 9-month net rises.</title>
<headline>Bank Niaga 9-month net rises.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   72.06 vs 46.17</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)   451 vs 293</p>
<p>    Net interest income	     241.68 vs 182.26</p>
<p>    Other operating income	   65.59 vs 64.04</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     98.20 vs 64.97</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Bank Niaga is one of Indonesia's largest privately-owned banks.</p>
</text>
